{"t":"rec","product":"agentrun","fit":"complement","why":"Serverless runtime providing sandboxes, model gateway and tracing for agents."}
{"t":"rec","product":"agentic-computer","fit":"complement","why":"Dedicated cloud computers to host always-on coding or browser agents."}
{"t":"done","summary":"Enterprise AI agent architecture with AgentCore governance, AgentRun runtime, AI Gateway, guardrails, security center and RAM."}

